# Claude
.claude/** linguist-vendored

# Tools
tools/** linguist-vendored

# Rust sources are LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Source-scan tests read their own file with include_str! and search it,
# so the bytes they see must not depend on the machine: Git for Windows'
# default CRLF checkout, the Windows CI runner's included, once failed
# tests that passed on an LF working copy.
*.rs text eol=lf
